      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: muslim_strip_club; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image juxtaposes a group of goats in a natural setting with the text 'muslim strip club,' creating a deliberately offensive and degrading stereotype. This is a form of Islamophobia, using a crude and sexually suggestive metaphor to mock Muslims, implying they are sexually promiscuous or morally degenerate. The visual of goats, often associated with rustic or 'primitive' imagery, is combined with the explicit phrase to reinforce a demeaning caricature. The intent is to provoke ridicule and spread harmful, hateful generalizations about a religious group, fitting the category of hateful content as it directly attacks a protected characteristic (religion) through offensive and degrading analogies.",
