      "label": "Goats are mapped as 'muslim strip club'",
      "description": "The text 'muslim strip club' is juxtaposed with the visual of goats, creating an analogical mapping where the goats are implicitly equated with Muslims in a degrading context. This mapping relies on the stereotype that Muslims are hypersexualized and morally degenerate, using the image of goats — often associated with rustic or primitive imagery — as a visual proxy for this harmful caricature. The mapping is not literal but symbolic, projecting the textual stereotype onto the visual entities (goats) to reinforce the hateful message.",
