      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the textual stereotype",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the text 'muslim strip club', which serves as the primary source of the hateful stereotype. The user is implicitly invited to internalize or identify with the degrading caricature being projected onto the visual material (goats) through this text. There are no explicit deictic pronouns like 'me' or 'you', but the meme's structure forces the viewer to confront the stereotype as if it were a direct address or accusation, making the user the recipient of the hateful projection.",
